    "title": "5th Down: UP high school football highlights and scores (9/25/26) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tor Thorne ,\n1 days ago\nHighlights and finals scores from a jampacked week five of high school football in the UP, headlined by our game of the week between the #3 Ishpeming Hematites and Gogebic Miners.\nHighlights:\nGogebic at #3 Ishpeming\nIronwood at Munising\n#2 Kingsford at #3 Calumet\nEscanaba at Marquette\nHancock at #5 Negaunee\nWestwood at Gladstone\nCOPYRIGHT 2026 BY MY UP NOW – WBUP/WJMN. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. THIS MATERIAL MAY NOT BE PUBLISHED, BROADCAST, REWRITTEN OR REDISTRIBUTED",
